<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>New Invoice — Handla</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #0a0a0f; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #e2e8f0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: rgba(15,15,30,0.95); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.3); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%); padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .detail-card { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #818cf8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; }
    .val { font-size: 15px; color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 500; text-align: right; }
    .amount { font-size: 22px; color: #a5b4fc; font-weight: 700; }
    .cta-wrapper { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.15); margin: 24px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; color: #475569; font-size: 12px; padding: 0 40px 32px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .footer a { color: #818cf8; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🧾 New Invoice Created</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="greeting">Hi <strong>{{recipientName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px;">
        A new invoice has been created. Please review and process it at your earliest convenience.
      </p>
      <div class="detail-card">
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Invoice #</span>
          <span class="val">{{invoiceNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Amount</span>
          <span class="val amount">{{amount}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Due Date</span>
          <span class="val">{{dueDate}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="{{erpUrl}}" class="cta-btn">View Invoice →</a>
      </div>
      <hr class="divider" />
      <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;text-align:center;margin:0;">
        Invoice <strong>#{{invoiceNumber}}</strong> — please process before the due date.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>You're receiving this because an invoice was created on <a href="{{baseUrl}}">Handla</a>.</p>
      <p>© {{year}} Handla. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
